From: OrangeFox PECM30 device maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] recovery: start Keystore2 after vendor HALs

PECM30 uses Keymaster and Gatekeeper services from the mounted stock vendor
partition. Keep recovery's built-in Keystore2 disabled until those services
are available.

diff --git a/etc/init/keystore2.rc b/etc/init/keystore2.rc
index 7ba482b..1a7e872 100644
--- a/etc/init/keystore2.rc
+++ b/etc/init/keystore2.rc
@@ -9,3 +8,0 @@
-on late-init
-    start keystore2
-
@@ -17,0 +15 @@ service keystore2 /system/bin/keystore2 /tmp/misc/keystore
+    disabled
